# Accepted findings for this demo, each with a reason. See README "Trade-offs".
# ALB listens on plain HTTP: no domain or certificate for a throwaway demo.
AVD-AWS-0054
# ALB security group allows ingress from 0.0.0.0/0: it is a public demo endpoint.
AVD-AWS-0107
# Fargate tasks have public IPs to avoid NAT gateway cost; the task SG only admits the ALB.
AVD-AWS-0164
# Load balancer is intentionally internet-facing.
AVD-AWS-0053
# CloudWatch log group uses the default AWS-managed encryption.
AVD-AWS-0017
# SNS topic uses default encryption for alarm notifications (no sensitive payload).
AVD-AWS-0095
# ECR uses AES256 (AWS-managed) rather than a customer-managed KMS key.
AVD-AWS-0033
# S3 state bucket uses AES256 (AWS-managed) rather than a customer-managed KMS key.
AVD-AWS-0132
# S3 access logging is not configured for the single state bucket in this demo.
AVD-AWS-0089
# ECS task definition uses plain environment variables (no secrets are passed).
AVD-AWS-0036
